---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="How Much Does Moving Cost? — Relocation Cost">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-14">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-sky-600">Guide</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">How much does moving cost?</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">Moving costs are driven by distance, the amount of belongings, labor, transport, packing, and the difficulty of the move.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">The main cost drivers</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-3 pl-6 leading-7 text-slate-700"><li>Distance and travel time</li><li>Home size and volume</li><li>DIY versus professional service</li><li>Packing and special-item handling</li><li>Stairs, parking, elevators, and access conditions</li></ul>
    <p class="mt-8 leading-7 text-slate-700">For an early budget, start with the <a class="font-semibold text-sky-700 underline" href="/calculator">moving cost calculator</a>, then replace the estimate with real quotes when you know your route and moving date.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
